@startuml testbed_sequence
title Testbed Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant Launcher as TestbedLauncher
participant Config as TestbedConfig
participant FS as FileSystem_generated_configs
participant Provider as TestbedRunnerProvider
participant Child as ChildWorkflow
participant Collector as AutoCaptureCollector
participant Store as OutputFiles

User -> Launcher: run(testbed.toml)
Launcher -> Config: load and validate TOML
Launcher -> FS: write generated child TOML(s)
Launcher -> Store: write initial plan/manifest

loop for each case
  Launcher -> Collector: create collector(run_id)
  Launcher -> Collector: capture_start()
  Launcher -> Provider: run_simulation(config_path)
  Provider -> Child: start child workflow
  Child -->> Provider: child summary (sim_id, metrics, files)
  Provider -->> Launcher: child summary
  Launcher -> Collector: capture_end(start_time)
  Collector -->> Launcher: snapshot
  Launcher -> Store: attach summary + snapshot, persist
end

Launcher -->> User: return compact summary (paths + counts)

note right of Provider
 Provider is registered at bootstrap (ProjectTestbedRunnerProvider)
 and delegates to actual workflow implementations.
end note

@enduml
